      "content": "wait i think i might have misread the manual/guide. can you double check if i need to list all of them the first time with 5 authors or if it's always 'et al.' from the get go? also why do these rules seem so cluttered and messy compared to like, older editions? it feels like there's way too much going on with the different rules for different counts.",
